OverTheWire Bandit: Level 32 → 33

Objective
Retrieve the password for Level 33.
The login shell converts all input to uppercase, restricting normal command execution.

Steps
Log in as bandit32:
ssh bandit32@bandit.labs.overthewire.org -p 2220
Execute a command using a special shell variable to bypass the restriction:
$0
Read the password file:
cat /etc/bandit_pass/bandit33

Result
The command outputs the password for Bandit Level 33, completing the Bandit wargame.
